---

<BaseLayout
  title="Kriya Kayu Abadi — Demo Katalog UMKM | Carisite"
  description="Contoh website katalog produk UMKM kerajinan kayu dengan cerita brand dan testimoni, dibuat oleh Carisite."
>
  <div class="bg-primary-deep px-4 py-2 text-center text-xs text-white sm:px-6">
    Contoh website (demo) yang dibuat oleh Carisite —
    <a href="/#demo" class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-2">lihat demo lain</a>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative flex min-h-[560px] items-center overflow-hidden bg-surface-low lg:min-h-[680px]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img src={HERO_IMG} alt="Bengkel kerajinan kayu artisan" width="1280" height="720" loading="eager" class="h-full w-full object-cover opacity-20" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-surface-low via-surface-low/90 to-transparent"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-container px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <span class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-primary-soft bg-primary-soft px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-primary-deep">
          <Icon name="lucide:leaf" class="h-4 w-4" /> 100% Kayu Lokal Berkelanjutan
        </span>
        <h1 class="mb-6 font-heading text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink sm:text-5xl">
          Sentuhan Alam <br /><span class="text-primary">Untuk Ruang Anda.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mb-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
          Kriya Kayu Abadi menghadirkan kerajinan kayu premium yang memadukan keindahan organik
          dengan desain fungsional modern. Karya pengrajin lokal untuk UMKM Indonesia.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="#katalog" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-primary-hover active:scale-95">
            Lihat Koleksi <Icon name="lucide:arrow-right" class="h-4 w-4" />
          </a>
          <a href="#cerita" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-outline-variant bg-surface px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink shadow-soft transition hover:bg-surface-high">Cerita Kami</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Produk Unggulan -->
  <section id="katalog" class="mx-auto max-w-container px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-3 font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Produk Unggulan Kami</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-ink-muted">Koleksi terlaris yang dirancang dengan presisi untuk menghadirkan kenyamanan dan estetika ke ruangan Anda.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      {products.map((p) => (
        <div class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface shadow-soft">
          <div class="relative h-[300px] overflow-hidden">
            <img src={p.img} alt={p.name} width="600" height="450" loading="lazy" class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
            <div class="absolute right-3 top-3 rounded-full border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container/90 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-ink backdrop-blur-sm">{p.price}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col p-6">
            <h3 class="mb-1 font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-ink">{p.name}</h3>
            <p class="mb-5 line-clamp-3 text-sm text-ink-muted">{p.desc}</p>
            <a href={orderLink(p.name)} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-auto inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-primary-hover">
              <Icon name="lucide:message-circle" class="h-4 w-4" /> Pesan via WA
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Cerita Kami -->
  <section id="cerita" class="border-y border-outline-variant bg-surface-low py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-container items-center gap-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-8">
      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-card">
        <img src={STORY_IMG} alt="Pengrajin kayu sedang bekerja" width="800" height="500" loading="lazy" class="h-[500px] w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" />
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
        <div class="mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary-deep">
          <Icon name="lucide:heart" class="h-5 w-5" />
          <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Dedikasi Kami</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mb-6 font-heading text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-ink">Cerita di Balik <br /><span class="text-primary">Serat Kayu.</span></h2>
        <p class="mb-3 text-lg text-ink-muted">
          Berawal dari bengkel kecil yang penuh serpihan kayu, Kriya Kayu Abadi lahir dari hasrat
          sederhana: menghadirkan kehangatan alam ke dalam rumah-rumah modern.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-8 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
          Kami bangga memberdayakan pengrajin lokal yang mewarisi keahlian pertukangan dari generasi
          ke generasi. Setiap material bersumber dari hutan yang dikelola bertanggung jawab — bagi kami,
          setiap guratan kayu menceritakan perjalanan.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-8 border-t border-outline-variant pt-6">
          <div><h4 class="mb-1 font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary">10+</h4><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Tahun Pengalaman</p></div>
          <div class="w-px bg-outline-variant"></div>
          <div><h4 class="mb-1 font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary">100%</h4><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Kayu Lokal</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Kenapa Memilih Kami -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-container px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-3 font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Kenapa Memilih Kami?</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-ink-muted">Komitmen kami untuk memberikan pengalaman dan kualitas terbaik di setiap pesanan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {reasons.map((r) => (
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface-lowest p-6 text-center shadow-soft transition-colors hover:border-primary/40">
          <span class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-soft text-primary-deep"><Icon name={r.icon} class="h-8 w-8" /></span>
          <h3 class="mb-1 font-heading text-lg font-semibold text-ink">{r.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">{r.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Testimoni -->
  <section class="border-t border-outline-variant bg-surface-high/40 py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-container px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-12 text-center">
        <h2 class="mb-3 font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Testimoni Pelanggan</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted">Kebahagiaan mereka adalah motivasi terbesar kami.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        {reviews.map((rev) => (
          <div class="relative flex h-full flex-col rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface p-8 shadow-soft">
            <Icon name="lucide:quote" class="absolute right-6 top-6 h-12 w-12 text-primary-soft" />
            <div class="mb-3 flex gap-1 text-accent">
              {Array.from({ length: rev.stars }).map(() => (
                <Icon name="lucide:star" class="h-5 w-5" />
              ))}
            </div>
            <p class="mb-6 flex-grow text-ink-muted">&ldquo;{rev.text}&rdquo;</p>
            <div class="mt-auto flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-outline-variant pt-4">
              <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface-high font-bold text-primary-deep">{rev.initial}</div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{rev.name}</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">{rev.role}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
